title: HyperGSD project showcase
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

HyperGSD is a series of plugins that helps you Get Stuff Done, supported by rich tools to work with the relations between them (making the system //hypermedia//).

; Actions (tasks)
: Short, single-step actions that accomplish a task.<br>Actions may also carry dependencies to/from other actions.
; Projects
: A collection of Actions that have a similar purpose or goal.
; Realms
: Divide your Actions/Projects into appropriate, custom groupings by tagging with <<tag-pill "$:/GSD/Realm/<RealmName>">> (e.g. <<tag-pill $:/GSD/Realm/Personal>>, <<tag-pill $:/GSD/Realm/Professional>>...)
; Dashboards for task management
: Manage your actions and projects through a number of dashboards.

HyperGSD carefully follows TiddlyWiki principles and is intended to integrate with an all-in-one personal wiki, but you can also use it standalone. It is tested against the vanilla theme.

! Install

Just drag and drop the core HyperGSD plugin to your wiki to install:

<$set name="qualified-state" value=<<qualify "$:/state/plugin">>>
{{$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd||$:/core/ui/Components/plugin-info}}

